From e769031575e4e08cc789260ca245fd2ba07815ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gz <gz@local>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 21:55:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add lv_appwindow widget and fix 3dstack row Y for
 near-at-bottom layout.

Introduce app UI container with pause/resume and thumbnail snapshot for
scenario 1 PLANE tiles; flip stack row Y so row 0 renders at screen bottom.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
